---
import { euStarsPath } from '../lib/icons/eu-stars';

// The four enterprise operating principles rendered as the administration surface they describe.
// The marks are decorative; every principle stays readable as plain text without them.
---

<figure class="governance-console" data-reveal aria-labelledby="governance-console-caption">
  <div class="product-frame">
    <div class="product-frame-bar">
      <div>
        <span class="product-mark" aria-hidden="true">Z</span>
        <span>Administration</span>
      </div>
      <span class="product-frame-status">Enterprise operating principles</span>
    </div>

    <ul class="governance-panels">
      <li>
        <svg class="governance-mark" viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
          <rect x="3" y="8" width="24" height="4" rx="2"></rect>
          <rect x="3" y="18" width="16" height="4" rx="2"></rect>
          <rect x="3" y="28" width="9" height="4" rx="2"></rect>
          <circle cx="33" cy="10" r="3.6"></circle>
        </svg>
        <h3>Knowledge access</h3>
        <p>Control access to connected company context.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <svg class="governance-mark" viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
          <circle class="governance-mark-open" cx="7" cy="20" r="5.6"></circle>
          <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="5.6"></circle>
          <circle class="governance-mark-open" cx="33" cy="20" r="5.6"></circle>
        </svg>
        <h3>Model choice</h3>
        <p>Offer options across approved providers.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <svg class="governance-mark" viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
          <path class="governance-mark-line" d="M2 20 H12.5"></path>
          <path class="governance-mark-line" d="M27.5 20 H38"></path>
          <rect class="governance-mark-line" x="13" y="13" width="14" height="14" rx="3.4"></rect>
          <path class="governance-mark-line" d="m16.4 20.2 2.5 2.5 4.7-5"></path>
        </svg>
        <h3>Human checkpoints</h3>
        <p>Keep review attached where judgment matters.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <svg class="governance-mark" viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
          <path class="governance-stars" d={euStarsPath}></path>
        </svg>
        <h3>EU operating focus</h3>
        <p>Keep European enterprise needs in view.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <figcaption id="governance-console-caption">
    The screen administrators use to set who sees what, which models are allowed, and where a person
    has to sign off.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
